OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor cleared over gender
OL,4,Adebate comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town councillor has been cleared of
OL,7,Fwrongdoing over comments made about a
OL,8,Fproposal on gender identity.
OL,10,FA Wiltshire Council official found that
OL,11,Fcomments made by Conservative Calne
OL,12,FTown Councillor Bobby Seymour
OL,13,Fconstituted "robust disagreement about
OL,14,Fpolicies or political ideas," and was
OL,15,Fnot unlawful discrimination.
OL,17,FThe comments came after Liberal
OL,18,FDemocrat councillor Aitch King, who
OL,19,Fidentifies as queer and non-binary,
OL,20,Fproposed an alternative to the titles
OL,21,Fof Honorary Freeman or Freewoman that
OL,22,Fis not gendered.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
