OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor cleared over gender
OL,4,Adebate comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeymour said that "the extreme left has
OL,7,Fshown that its priorities are to impose
OL,8,Fits own gender obsessed ideology,".
OL,9,FKing said they "disagree with the
OL,10,Fdecision" to clear him.
